  "solution": "The logic followed here is :** (1st number - 3rd number) **× 5 = 2nd number\n\nGiven :\n\n__\n \n• (36, 90, 18)​\n\n​**(36 - 18)**__ × 5 = 90\n\n__**18 × 5**__ = 90\n\n90 = 90 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• (15, 35, 8)\n\n**(15 - 8)**__ × 5 = 35\n\n__**7 × 5**__ = 35\n\n35 = 35 (LHS = RHS)",
